+/*
+ * The APCS/L2 SAW at 0xb012000 carries the PMIC arbiter and is the master that
+ * drives the shared VDD_APC (PM8916 S2) rail.  Unlike the per-CPU SAWs its SPM
+ * sequence is owned by the secure/PSCI firmware, so only the voltage registers
+ * (VCTL/PMIC_DATA_3, kicked via RST and polled through PMIC_STS) are touched
+ * here.
